@startuml
!include ../../theme.puml
title PEP：复用协议，各执行点保有事实
skinparam linetype polyline
package "L1 业务执行宿主" {
 class L1ProposalFreezer
 class DecisionOutcomeHandlers
}
interface PermissionDecisionPort
interface PermitValidationPort
package "L3 ToolCallRuntime" {
 class ResolvedActionVerifier
 class PermitClient
 class ExecutionStarter {
   startOnce(grant, expectedVersion)
 }
 class ReconciliationReader
 class ToolCall {
   phase
   version
   receiptRef
   startGrantRef
 }
}
interface ToolProviderPort
interface SandboxPort
class MemoryExecutionPEP
class ChildAdmissionPEP
L1ProposalFreezer --> DecisionOutcomeHandlers
DecisionOutcomeHandlers --> PermissionDecisionPort : decide / inspect
DecisionOutcomeHandlers --> ResolvedActionVerifier : 已提交 DispatchTool
ResolvedActionVerifier --> PermitClient
PermitClient --> PermitValidationPort : consume / authorizeStart
ExecutionStarter --> PermitClient : 取得当前 Grant
ExecutionStarter --> ToolCall : STARTED CAS
ExecutionStarter --> ToolProviderPort : 仅胜者
ExecutionStarter --> SandboxPort : 固定执行路径
ReconciliationReader --> ToolCall : 原命令结果
MemoryExecutionPEP --> PermitValidationPort
ChildAdmissionPEP --> PermitValidationPort
note bottom of ChildAdmissionPEP
 FE 拥有关联、取消、受理与恢复
 跨 Flow DTO 仍待 SR-04
end note
note bottom of PermitClient
 不依赖 PDP；不做第二次裁决
 不缓存旧成功作为新执行权
end note
@enduml
